		<<option "전통" "traditional">>
	<</listbox>>
	<br>
	왼쪽 날개 유형:
	<<listbox "$characterViewer.bodyState.angelWingsLeftType" autoselect>>
		<<option "보통" "idle">>
		<<option "가리기" "cover">>
	<</listbox>>
	||
	오른쪽 날개 유형:
